{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51238","headline":"丹霄驿诗刻 · 李隆基","name":"丹霄驿诗刻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驿前南面架危桥，久欲登临畏路遥。\n今日偶然寻得到。\n直从平地上丹霄。\n（《舆地纪胜》一○七《昭州》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李隆基","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51238.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51238","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}